# Documentation locations

- **Plans / architectural discussions / Cursor plans** → `.cursor/plans/`
- **Module BRD / SDD / QA system tests** → `devops/docs/system_docs/`
  - `BRD/*-BRD.md` (flat, numbered)
  - `SDD/*-SDD.md` (design + unit-test inventory)
  - `ST-UI/*-ST-UI.md` (Playwright)
  - `ST-API/<service>-ST-API.md` (pytest)
- **Cross-module specs not yet owned** → `devops/docs/req & design/`
- Do not put new specs in `devops/docs/` root, `devops/docs/design/`, or `devops/docs/modules_docs/`.
- Full detail: `devops/docs/rules/AI_RULES.md` (Documentation locations).
